<title>USA: Pepsi seen Major League Baseball's drink - WSJ.</title>
<headline>Pepsi seen Major League Baseball's drink - WSJ.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>PepsiCo is expected to announce a five-year agreement with Major League Baseball to be the game's official soft drink, the Wall Street Journal reported in its electronic edition on Wendesay.</p>
<p>Pepsi was expected to spend more than $50 million under the agreement, mostly on advertising and promotional spending, the paper said, citing individuals familiar with the deal.</p>
<p>--New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
